          "type": "text",
          "text": "- [x]  “I would still like the video to be edited again. Visually, it just doesn’t represent my"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "operations, which worries me since it’s the very first thing people will see. However, if we shorten it even more I can live with that. I want the video to begin where grain is being poured out of a white bag then we see grain moving and grain being shaken down out of the wooden hopper into the millstones. I’d like the video to end there. Your visual cue is it should end just before you see the white flour bag being bounced on the floor, just before it circles back around again to the wheat field. Basically, I only want to see the parts of the video where grain is being poured.”"
        }
      ]
    },
